==Description== <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The [[Image:PartDesign_CircularPattern.svg|24px]] '''PartDesign CircularPattern''' tool duplicates selected features or the active body in concentric circular patterns. This tool allows to disable individual pattern elements.

